ed (repository_delta=present, 22 changed path(s))\\n===CHECKPOINT-HELP===\\nCheckpoint an accepted Change Request revision.\\n\\nThe accepted candidate tree becomes one internal commit on the Story branch,\\ncreated under a compare-and-swap on the branch tip. The leaf remains integrating:\\nnothing is landed on trunk, and internal checkpoints only delimit later Task\\ndiffs and make the work recoverable before the final Story squash.\\n\\nA Change Request with repository_delta=empty creates no commit — its tree would\\nequal its parent's — and the leaf likewise remains integrating.\\n\\nOnly the tracked integration run bound to the accepted revision's producer role\\nand archetype may run this command. Reviewers, orchestrators, and other producer\\narchetypes are refused.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board worktree checkpoint <ELEMENT-ID> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help   help for checkpoint\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2094,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 524,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
